# App Store marketing screenshots — build output, not source.
#
# tools/capture_screenshots.sh regenerates these by playing the game, and
# nothing in the app or CI reads them. They're ~65 MB per capture of PNGs that
# git can't delta-compress, so committing them would make a 340 KB repo ~200x
# bigger, permanently, on every refresh. Upload them to App Store Connect (which
# then holds the submitted set) or attach a zip to the GitHub Release.
design/screenshots/appstore/

# Misc
*.log
